  "outcome": "escalate",
  "rationale": "It is recommended to escalate this claim because the total amount of loss is at or above the $30,000 threshold, requiring senior adjuster review. Section 6. Claim Handling governs this requirement for high-value claims. The key fact is the total estimated repair cost of $30,200.00.",
  "citations": [
    {
      "clause_id": "STD-6.1",
      "quote": "Any claim where the amount of loss is at or above $30,000 must be escalated to a senior adjuster for review before any payment is authorized, even if no exclusion appears to apply."
    }
  ]
